---
---

<section id="feature-icon-grid" class="section feature-icon-grid">
  <!-- kit: feature-icon-grid -->
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why cast iron</span>
      <h2>Gear that gets better every time you cook.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Every Caldera piece is poured, machined and seasoned in Bend, Oregon — then guaranteed for life.</p>
    </header>

    <ul class="fig-list" role="list">
      <li class="fig-item">
        <span class="fig-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.07-2.14-.22-4.05 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.15.43-2.29 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Rated to 900°F</h3>
        <p>Straight onto coals, into a pizza oven or under the broiler. No coatings to burn off.</p>
        <a class="fig-link" href="/journal/heat-ratings" title="Heat ratings">How we test <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="fig-item">
        <span class="fig-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.24 12.24a6 6 0 0 0-8.49-8.49L5 10.5V19h8.5z"/><path d="M16 8 2 22"/><path d="M17.5 15H9"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>40% lighter</h3>
        <p>Thin-wall casting gets a 10" skillet under four pounds without losing heat retention.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="fig-item">
        <span class="fig-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5C6 11.1 5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Pre-seasoned three times</h3>
        <p>Flaxseed and grapeseed oil, baked on in layers. Cook eggs on day one.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="fig-item">
        <span class="fig-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Lifetime warranty</h3>
        <p>Crack it, warp it, lose the handle — we replace it. No receipt needed.</p>
        <a class="fig-link" href="/warranty" title="Warranty">Read the warranty <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="fig-item">
        <span class="fig-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 19H4.8a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.6-2.7L7 9.8"/><path d="M11 19h8.2a1.8 1.8 0 0 0 1.6-2.7l-1.2-2.1"/><path d="m14 16-3 3 3 3"/><path d="M8.3 13.6 7 9.8 3.2 11"/><path d="m9.3 5.6 1.1-1.9a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 3.1 0l3.9 6.7"/><path d="m13.4 9.6 3.9.8.8-3.9"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Recycled iron</h3>
        <p>92% of our iron is reclaimed from scrap engine blocks and radiators.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="fig-item">
        <span class="fig-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h8a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M9 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M8 21v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5"/><path d="M8 10h8"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Packs flat</h3>
        <p>Folding handles and nesting lids fit a 45-litre pack with room for food.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="btn-row fig-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/products" title="Products">Compare cookware <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .fig-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2.5rem 2rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .fig-item h3 {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }
  .fig-item p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .fig-icon {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--brand-soft);
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .fig-link {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--brand);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .fig-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .fig-cta {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .fig-list { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .fig-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  }
</style>
